    <briefdescription>
<para>This class implements <ndash/>time-trace functionality for new pass manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It provides the pass-instrumentation callbacks that measure the pass execution time. They collect time tracing info by TimeProfiler. </para>
